<title>UK: CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE BEAT AUSTRALIA BY ONE WICKET.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE BEAT AUSTRALIA BY ONE WICKET.</headline>
<dateline>DERBY, England 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derbyshire beat Australia by one wicket in their three-day match ending on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 362-6 declared and and 265-4 declared, Derbyshire 257-9 declared and 371-9 (C.Adams 91, A.Rollins 66, D.Jones 57; S.Warne 7-103).</p>
</text>
